：如果在盘查中被发现，店铺将被永久查封，你也会被立即逮捕。\\n此外，如果发现任何违禁品，你在治安部的声望都会下降。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"card_rev\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":20,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":1,\"data\":[1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":6,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":7,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":1,\"data\":[1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"名片（绿）\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"简单的绿色名片，上面写着一个电话号码。\",\"uniqueId\":324,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/items_misc\",\"spritePath\":\"card_rev\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRIN